# Deny by default; explicitly include code required at build/runtime.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!environments/
!environments/**
!patches/
!patches/**
!pipeline/
!pipeline/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!experiment_files/
!experiment_files/sam3_train_config/
!experiment_files/sam3_train_config/**
!LICENSES/
!LICENSES/**
# Never send generated/private content, including under otherwise allowed directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/.git/
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.png
**/*.zip
**/*.tar*
**/*.log
**/training_runs/
**/runs/
**/wandb/
**/credentials*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

**/ground_truths/
**/datasets/
**/finetuning-data/
**/eval_results/
